Regent is a man clad in layers of fine furs and gaudy jewelry. His face is perpetually shaded despite the lack of anything that might actually obscure his features. Atop his head is a precariously stacked tower of crowns of all manner of metals and woods, jeweled with every gemstone under the sun.

A likeness of Regent under a stack of crowns stands on one of the six god doors in the fane beneath the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/Gas-n-Go|Gas-n-Go]]. Behind the door is an orrery, a device [[Org/The Scale/index|the Scale]] use.

[[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] knows Regent as Paimon, a fourth-generation Thessian.
